window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>My goddess is reborn.</p> <p>The mouthy peacock shifter I find is not the woman I knew. She's somehow more.</p> <p>More human. More lovely. More sinful.</p> <p>And I want her more than I ever have before.</p> <p>There's just one problem.</p> <p>She doesn't remember her past lifetimes-or that I've killed her in every single one.</p> <p>Contains mature themes.</p>"; 
